    <item>
      <title>Serum Lithium and Cognitive Decline: A Survival Analysis in Bipolar Disorder</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1314/project/paper-2/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 01 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1314/project/paper-2/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;This study examines the relationship between serum lithium levels and Alzheimer&amp;rsquo;s/MCI risk using a large-scale EHR dataset. We identified a U-shaped hazard relationship, with an optimal neuroprotective lithium range, while correcting for reverse causation through landmark analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
